{
  "_about": "J.A.R.V.I.S. eval set. Each case is one fresh chat question answered by the same code as /api/jarvis/chat. mustInclude: every pattern must match the reply; mustNotInclude: none may. Patterns are case-insensitive regexes. $START_MONTHS expands to the month(s) 4–5 weeks from today. Optional audience fills the prompt's {{audience}}; expectTool checks a site action (name + params).",
